#: knights.cpp:191
msgid ""
"The Open command will allow you to select a previously saved game and play "
"it again."
msgstr ""
"O comando Abrir permite-lle escoller unha partida previamente guardada e voltar a "
"xogá-la."

#: knights.cpp:192
msgid "This command removes the current match."
msgstr "Este comando elimina a partida actual."

#: knights.cpp:193
msgid "This command will remove all matches that are currently loaded."
msgstr "Este comando elimina todas as partidas que estexan actualmente carregadas."

#: knights.cpp:194 knights.cpp:195
msgid ""
"The Save command will allow you to store a copy of your current game for "
"later use."
msgstr "O comando Guardar permite-lle guardar unha cópia da partida actual, para usá-la despois."

#: knights.cpp:196
msgid ""
"The Print command will allow you to print this game's notation on your "
"printer."
msgstr ""
"O comando Imprimir permite-lle imprimir as xogadas desta partida pola sua "
"impresora."

#: knights.cpp:197
msgid "The Quit command will stop the current game and exit Knights."
msgstr "O comando Sair termina a partida actual e sai de Knights."

#: knights.cpp:198
msgid ""
"If checked, this option tells Knights that you will play as the White army "
"when you play vs. the computer."
msgstr ""
"Se a escolle, esta opzón determina que xogará coas brancas cando xoga "
"contra o ordenador."

#: knights.cpp:199
msgid ""
"If checked, this option tells Knights that you will play as the Black army "
"when you play vs. the computer."
msgstr ""
"Se a escolle, esta opzón determina que xogará coas negras cando xoga "
"contra o ordenador."

#: knights.cpp:200
msgid ""
"This opens a new window which allows you to customize Knights to your "
"particular tastes."
msgstr ""
"Esta opzón abre unha fiestra onde poderá personalizar Knights de acordo coas "
"suas preferéncias persoais."

